meta {
  name: Get All History
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/history
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All History

  This request is used to get all history when user use the App. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and has a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — history fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "history fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "history_type": "Create",
          "history_context": "Barang bawaan",
          "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47",
          "created_by": "2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — history failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "history not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}